{"seq":3,"slug":"political-thought","title":"圣雄甘地·政治思想","stage":"DONE","category":"mahatma-gandhi","categoryLabel":"圣雄甘地","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mahatma-gandhi/political-thought","rating":{"composite":3.6,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/leaders/19_mahatma-gandhi/3_political-thought","introHtml":"<p>把甘地只记成&quot;那个搞非暴力的瘦老头&quot;，会错过他思想真正的分量。这个侧面不复述他一生做了哪些事，而是把镜头对准他信念的内在逻辑：他在 1906 年的约翰内斯堡为什么要新造一个词&quot;真理坚固&quot;（Satyagraha）来跟&quot;消极抵抗&quot;划清界限、他从耆那教与印度教传统里继承的&quot;非暴力&quot;（Ahimsa）为何被托尔斯泰、罗斯金、梭罗的著作重新点燃、以及他如何把&quot;自我治理&quot;（Swaraj）从一个政治口号扩展成对人、对村庄、对整个文明的要求。</p>\n<p>它面向的是想弄懂甘地&quot;为什么这么想、这套想法自洽不自洽&quot;的普通历史读者——不是要把他供成圣人，而是把抽象的道德主张放回它诞生的具体历史里：哪一年、在哪场抗争中、针对哪一部法律、受了哪一本书的影响。每一处概念都尽量给出可核验的年份、人物与文本，而非空泛的赞美。</p>\n<p>它与兄弟侧面分工明确：<a href=\"../life-and-career/\">生平与事业</a>叙述&quot;发生了什么&quot;的完整时间线；<a href=\"../core-policies/\">核心政策</a>讲他主张的制度与社会安排；<a href=\"../major-events/\">重大事件</a>聚焦食盐进军、退出印度等里程碑节点；<a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与历史地位</a>评估他留给印度与世界的长远遗产；<a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a>直面对他的质疑与史学定论。本侧面不重复这些&quot;发生了什么&quot;，而专门处理&quot;他到底是怎么想的、这套思想从何而来、为何能成为一种斗争方法&quot;。</p>\n<p>三章依次展开：<a href=\"satyagraha/\">真理坚固</a>讲他自创的&quot;真理之力&quot;——这套方法如何在 1906 年成形、又如何在 1917 年的占巴朗、1930 年的食盐进军中被反复检验；<a href=\"ahimsa/\">非暴力</a>梳理&quot;不害&quot;这一信念的宗教根源与现代思想来源，以及它为什么不只是策略；<a href=\"swaraj/\">自我治理</a>阐述他对独立、自主与自律的层层理解。读完三章，你应当能看清：甘地的政治思想不是零散的格言，而是一套以&quot;真理&quot;与&quot;非暴力&quot;为两块基石、彼此咬合的完整体系。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"satyagraha","title":"真理坚固","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mahatma-gandhi/political-thought/satyagraha","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-philosophy-of-satyagraha","title":"真理坚固的哲学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mahatma-gandhi/political-thought/satyagraha/the-philosophy-of-satyagraha"},{"seq":2,"slug":"truth-as-a-force","title":"真理作为力量","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mahatma-gandhi/political-thought/satyagraha/truth-as-a-force"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"ahimsa","title":"非暴力","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mahatma-gandhi/political-thought/ahimsa","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-principle-of-ahimsa","title":"非暴力的原则","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mahatma-gandhi/political-thought/ahimsa/the-principle-of-ahimsa"},{"seq":2,"slug":"love-over-hatred","title":"以爱化解仇恨","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mahatma-gandhi/political-thought/ahimsa/love-over-hatred"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"swaraj","title":"自治与自我","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mahatma-gandhi/political-thought/swaraj","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-meaning-of-swaraj","title":"自治的含义","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mahatma-gandhi/political-thought/swaraj/the-meaning-of-swaraj"},{"seq":2,"slug":"simple-living-and-self-discipline","title":"简朴生活与自律","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mahatma-gandhi/political-thought/swaraj/simple-living-and-self-discipline"}]}]}